      "problem": "What is the range of the function $f$ defined by the following table?\n\n| $x$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $-1$ | $4$ | $3$ | $-1$ | $4$ | $2$ | $0$ |",
